<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2646952059"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1779892650"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="礎の花冠"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Roselia"/><amll:meta key="album" value="礎の花冠"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:06.987"><div begin="00:15.329" end="03:56.712"><p begin="00:15.329" end="00:18.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">眩しいな こんなにも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光芒如此璀璨耀眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi i na ko n na ni mo</span></p><p begin="00:19.982" end="00:24.407" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">あの日から変わらないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自那天起便不曾有所改变</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi ka ra ka wa ra na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:26.212" end="00:31.967" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">一番ほしい言葉で手を取って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说着我最想听到的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ba n ho shi i ko to ba de</span></p><p begin="00:33.256" end="00:35.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">連れ出してくれた</p><p begin="00:35.737" end="00:38.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">(目と目合わせ 微笑み合って)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(四目相对 微笑相迎)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( me to me a wa se ho ho e mi a 't te )</span></p><p begin="00:38.609" end="00:40.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">紡ぎ合わせてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我一起编织而出的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu mu gi a wa se te yu ku</span></p><p begin="00:41.313" end="00:43.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">(手と手合わせ 感謝を込め)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(双手相牵 满怀感谢)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( te to te a wa se ka n sha wo ko me )</span></p><p begin="00:44.098" end="00:46.276" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">一音一句と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个音符每句话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi o n i 'k ku to</span></p><p begin="00:46.842" end="00:49.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">(声を繋いで 夢を渡って)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(声音相连 跨越梦想)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ko e wo tsu na i de yu me wo wa ta 't te )</span></p><p begin="00:49.695" end="00:51.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">互いの想いが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以及各自的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ga i no o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="00:52.423" end="00:55.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">音楽という奇跡を奏でてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都将奏响名为音乐的奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o n ga ku to i u ki se ki wo ka na de te ku</span></p><p begin="00:56.926" end="00:58.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">輝きの中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在璀璨的光芒中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ki no na ka</span></p><p begin="01:03.275" end="01:08.283" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">この先も隣で 貴方と歌わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往后也要彼此为伴 让我与你一同歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki mo to na ri de a na ta to u ta wa se te</span></p><p begin="01:08.913" end="01:13.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">約束の景色と共に もう一度誓う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次在许下约定的景色之中立下誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku so ku no ke shi ki to to mo ni mo u i chi do chi ka u</span></p><p begin="01:14.395" end="01:19.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ずっと傍にいると 小指を交わして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直与你相伴 然后勾起对方的小指</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to so ba ni i ru to ko yu bi wo ka wa shi te</span></p><p begin="01:19.990" end="01:23.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Ever, Ever after</p><p begin="01:35.103" end="01:38.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">迎えに来てくれたね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论多么漆黑的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ka e ni ki te ku re ta ne</span></p><p begin="01:39.658" end="01:44.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">どんなに暗い夜でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你都会前来将我迎接</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ni ku ra i yo ru de mo</span></p><p begin="01:46.061" end="01:47.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">不器用でいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管笨拙无措</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu ki yo u de i te</span></p><p begin="01:48.634" end="01:55.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">とても優しくて 気高い姿で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却无比温柔 模样是如此高洁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to te mo ya sa shi ku te ke da ka i su ga ta de</span></p><p begin="01:55.836" end="02:00.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">この先も隣で 悲しみに暮れたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往后也要彼此为伴 哪怕沉浸于悲伤之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki mo to na ri de ka na shi mi ni ku re ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:01.337" end="02:04.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">もう立ち止まりはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然会步履不停地前进下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ta chi do ma ri wa shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:04.431" end="02:06.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">逃げもしないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更不会轻易逃避</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni ge mo shi na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:06.862" end="02:09.107" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">また明日が来るんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明天依然会如约而至</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta a shi ta ga ku ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:09.581" end="02:11.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">素晴らしい瞬間で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在如此美妙的瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ba ra shi i shu n ka n de</span></p><p begin="02:12.472" end="02:15.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Ever, Ever after</p><p begin="02:38.504" end="02:41.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">(目と目合わせ 頷き合って)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(四目相对 点头应允)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( me to me a wa se u na zu ki a 't te )</span></p><p begin="02:41.416" end="02:43.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">いつかその頭上に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将曾经在头顶之上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka so no zu jo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:43.991" end="02:46.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">(手と手合わせ 祈りを込め)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(双手相牵 诚心祈祷)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( te to te a wa se i no ri wo ko me )</span></p><p begin="02:46.793" end="02:49.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">永遠の煌めきを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁的永恒光辉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to wa no ki ra me ki wo</span></p><p begin="02:49.638" end="02:52.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">(諦めないで 願う未来へ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(绝不放弃 奔赴期许的未来)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( a ki ra me na i de ne ga u mi ra i he )</span></p><p begin="02:52.640" end="02:57.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">胸に息づく愛しさを礎に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与深藏于心的爱为力量来源</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne ni i ki zu ku i to shi sa wo i shi zu e ni</span></p><p begin="02:57.213" end="03:01.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">何度でも 足を踏み出そう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次又一次朝前迈出步伐吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do de mo a shi wo fu mi da so u</span></p><p begin="03:06.311" end="03:10.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">この先も隣で 貴方と歌わせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">往后也要彼此为伴 让我与你一同歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki mo to na ri de a na ta to u ta wa se te</span></p><p begin="03:11.558" end="03:16.617" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">約束の景色と共に もう一度誓う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次在许下约定的景色之中立下誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku so ku no ke shi ki to to mo ni mo u i chi do chi ka u</span></p><p begin="03:17.165" end="03:22.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">ずっと傍にいると 小指を交わして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直与你相伴 然后勾起对方的小指</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to so ba ni i ru to ko yu bi wo ka wa shi te</span></p><p begin="03:22.864" end="03:26.101" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">Ever, Ever after</p><p begin="03:28.373" end="03:31.879" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Embrace music forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">演奏这音乐直至永远</span></p><p begin="03:33.832" end="03:36.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">顔を上げて 前を向いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抬起头来 勇往直前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka o wo a ge te ma e wo mu i te</span></p><p begin="03:36.474" end="03:38.669" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">歩き続けてゆくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断地迈出步伐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ki tsu zu ke te yu ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:39.396" end="03:41.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">悔しくたって 落ち込んだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算悔恨不甘 就算灰心气馁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ya shi ku ta 't te o chi ko n da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:42.039" end="03:44.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">どうしようもないほどに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍让我幸福到无以复加的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u shi yo u mo na i ho do ni</span></p><p begin="03:44.793" end="03:47.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">幸せなんだ この居場所が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是属于我自身的那个归所</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se na n da ko no i ba sho ga</span></p><p begin="03:47.507" end="03:49.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">隣には貴方が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以及身旁的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to na ri ni wa a na ta ga</span></p><p begin="03:50.310" end="03:53.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">頂きへと すべてを賭ける覚悟で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴巅峰 带着不惜赌上一切的决心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta da ki he to su be te wo ka ke ru ka ku go de</span></p><p begin="03:53.783" end="03:56.712" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">私達は行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将一往无前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi wa i ku</span></p></div></body></tt>